191
00:07:00,898 --> 00:07:03,176
doctrine, producing ideologues rather than

192
00:07:03,189 --> 00:07:03,749
fighters.

193
00:07:05,157 --> 00:07:06,902
Here's where we have to be careful,

194
00:07:07,175 --> 00:07:09,181
